<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:18:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>中国希望解决机器人技术中最难的问题——制造双手</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/china-wants-to-solve-the-hardest-problem-in-robotics-making-hands</link><description>人手是灵活、充满神经的附肢，是人体骨骼中最灵活的部分，而且异常复杂。大多数人无需思考就能完成的许多任务，从系鞋带到扣衬衫扣子，实际上都需要一套复杂的神经指令和精确的编排。在人类几千年的历史中，没有任何机器能够真正复制人类最伟大的工具。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/china-wants-to-solve-the-hardest-problem-in-robotics-making-hands.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:18:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/china-wants-to-solve-the-hardest-problem-in-robotics-making-hands</guid></item><item><title>与 Claude 一起发现密码学弱点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses-with-claude</link><description>人类研究人员通过 Claude Mythos Preview 发现加密算法的弱点&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses-with-claude.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:03:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses-with-claude</guid></item><item><title>喷涂涂层可以更紧密地捕获颗粒，并使空气过滤器的使用寿命几乎延长一倍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/spray-on-coating-traps-particles-more-tightly-and-nearly-doubles-air-filter-lifespan</link><description>呼吸清洁的空气对人类健康至关重要，因此空气过滤器在家庭、医院、工作场所和工业环境中不可或缺。然而，尽管过滤材料和设计取得了数十年的进步，但重大挑战仍然存在。捕获空气中的颗粒只是成功的一半；让他们安全地被困住也同样重要。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spray-on-coating-traps-particles-more-tightly-and-nearly-doubles-air-filter-lifespan2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:48:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/spray-on-coating-traps-particles-more-tightly-and-nearly-doubles-air-filter-lifespan</guid></item><item><title>摘要：系统和计算生物学中心，以及</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/abstract-center-for-systems-and-computational-biology-and</link><description>2&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/abstract165.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:33:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/abstract-center-for-systems-and-computational-biology-and</guid></item><item><title>太空的指数级技术时刻以及保护它的需求</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/spaces-exponential-tech-moment-and-the-need-to-secure-it</link><description>太空已成为我们数字社会的基石，它正在创造必须得到保护的技术创新。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spaces-exponential-tech-moment-and-the-need-to-secure-it.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:18:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/spaces-exponential-tech-moment-and-the-need-to-secure-it</guid></item><item><title>中国Moonshot因需求旺盛和IPO推动而暂停Kimi订阅</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/chinas-moonshot-pauses-kimi-subscriptions-amid-hot-demand-ipo-push</link><description>上海/香港，7 月 20 日（路透社）——中国初创公司 Moonshot AI 在对其新推出的产品需求旺盛后暂时停止了新订阅&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chinas-moonshot-pauses-kimi-subscriptions-amid-hot-demand-ipo-push.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:03:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/chinas-moonshot-pauses-kimi-subscriptions-amid-hot-demand-ipo-push</guid></item><item><title>新的驾驶人工智能对可能的路线进行排序，以做出更安全、更清晰的决策</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/new-driving-ai-ranks-possible-routes-for-safer-clearer-decisions</link><description>首尔国立大学工程学院电气与计算机工程系教授 Jun Won Choi 领导的研究团队开发了 SafeDrive，这是一种端到端 (E2E) 自动驾驶人工智能模型，符合自动驾驶技术的最新全球趋势。该工作被选为计算机视觉与模式识别会议（Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition）的亮点论文（ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-driving-ai-ranks-possible-routes-for-safer-clearer-decisions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:48:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/new-driving-ai-ranks-possible-routes-for-safer-clearer-decisions</guid></item><item><title>重复距离模式让光学系统能够解决大型优化问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/repeating-distance-patterns-let-optical-systems-tackle-large-optimization-problems</link><description>从规划交通网络到组织海量数据集，社会上许多最重要的挑战都归结为优化问题：在大量可能性中找到最佳解决方案。然而，随着这些问题的规模和范围不断扩大，解决这些问题所需的计算资源也会急剧增加。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/repeating-distance-patterns-let-optical-systems-tackle-large-optimization-problems2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:33:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/repeating-distance-patterns-let-optical-systems-tackle-large-optimization-problems</guid></item><item><title>帕金森病患者壳核多巴胺合成、囊泡储存和代谢</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/putamen-dopamine-synthesis-vesicular-storage-and-metabolism-in-patients-with-parkinson-disease</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/putamen-dopamine-synthesis-vesicular-storage-and-metabolism-in-patients-with-parkinson-disease2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:18:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/putamen-dopamine-synthesis-vesicular-storage-and-metabolism-in-patients-with-parkinson-disease</guid></item><item><title>调节血脑屏障的细胞和信号机制评论分子细胞生物学</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/cellular-and-signalling-mechanisms-that-regulate-the-bloodbrain-barrier-reviews-molecular-cell-biology</link><description>本综述总结了血脑屏障 (BBB) 研究的最新进展，强调了通过细胞相互作用和信号通路调节 BBB 功能和异质性的新发现如何可能塑造 BBB 靶向治疗。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cellular-and-signalling-mechanisms-that-regulate-the-bloodbrain-barrier-reviews-molecular-cell-biology2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:03:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/cellular-and-signalling-mechanisms-that-regulate-the-bloodbrain-barrier-reviews-molecular-cell-biology</guid></item></channel></rss>